  Apply the mandatory no-shim contract to every unit, including callers, tests and obsolete API removal.
  Earlier source-closure receipts do not exempt any of the sites explicitly listed below.

Phase 8a: Route framebuffer cache policy and frame lifecycle through RHI
  Depends on Phase 7.

  ☑ Remove direct OpenGlStateCache guards from GpuFramebuffer.SetAttachmentCore, RemoveAttachmentCore,
