    Apply 8g's removal policy: retain a backend effect only for actual retirement or established uncertainty,
    not merely because ownership, attachments or publication changed.
  ☑ Remove StaticGpuFramebuffer.configurationOwner and direct RegisterImmutableFramebuffer /
    UnregisterImmutableFramebuffer calls in construction, ReleaseConfiguration and OnContextRetiring.
    Keep one immutable-configuration authority beneath RHI with original-context retirement, balanced
