  ☑ Preserve screen callback ordering and uniform epochs through their existing lifecycle owners.
    Remove the redundant resize/frame cache purges under 8g; do not introduce semantic lifecycle methods
    whose purpose is to forward the same blanket invalidation through RHI.
  ☑ Route GpuProgram.RequireOutsideSubmission's direct RequireOutsideEngineBoundary guard through RHI.
    Inspect the analogous EngineGeometryInputs guard against its explicit integration contract; retain
