  ☑ Verify immutable rejection, resize/replacement, detach/disposal, context retirement, frame epochs and
    engine-boundary admission. Remove wrapper imports/stored types exposing the concrete cache.

  Qualification: second source review and independent stage-completion audit passed against the approved
